.TH TEMPLE 1
.SH NAME
temple \- collection of games and demos for Wm
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/
.I name
.br
.B wmapp /Apps/!Temple
.I Name
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B temple
programs are graphical games, demos, and small applications that run under
.IR wm (1).
Each may be started as
.BI temple/ name
or from the Wm
.B TempleOS
menu.
.PP
Several titles use
.IR draw3d (2)
for perspective drawing,
.IR ode (2)
for mass-spring physics, and
.IR tone (2)
for sound.
.IR Draw3ddemo (1)
(Misc menu
.BR Draw3d )
exercises the 3-D library alone.
.PP
Unless noted otherwise, quit with
.B q
or
.B Esc
and restart with
.B Enter
or
.BR r .
